============================================================
OVERVIEW
============================================================

ForgeUI is a custom ESP32-P4 application framework and UI
baseline developed for embedded systems using:

- ESP-IDF (v5.5.4 Optimized)
- LVGL (v9.2.2 High-Performance Graphics Engine)
- ESP-Hosted WiFi (ESP32-C6 Coprocessor Architecture)
- Waveshare ESP32-P4-WIFI6-Touch-LCD-7B board support ecosystems
- Related managed hardware abstraction components

ForgeUI provides a reusable embedded application structure,
runtime architecture, and hardware-proven UI baseline.


============================================================
